  "description": "26\" Single Speed Men's Beach Cruiser Bike - Simple but Efficient\nThe Tracer Nova Complete Cruiser Bike for Men features a durable Hi-Ten steel frame and 26-inch wheels, perfect for any adult rider. This hybrid bike offers a Shimano single-speed setup, making it ideal for smooth cruising on flat terrains. With fat tires and a beach cruiser design, it's the perfect choice for comfort and style. Available in multiple colors, the Tracer Nova is your go-to men's bike for relaxed rides, whether you're hitting the beach or enjoying a leisurely ride around town.\n\nEASIER RIDING: The TRACER Nova beach cruiser is built for your comfort and relaxation. 26\"×2.125\" Inch Wheels, adult bicycle tires, enough to meet different kinds of rolling, whether a casual riding with families, friends, or for commuting use. You get to choose two-toned color options that suit your personality.\nSAFER RIDING: The Stunning Nova beach cruiser demonstrates some of the professional components like alloy seat post, coaster brakes, stainless steel spokes, 26’’X2.125” whitewall tires, and colored fenders.\nHIGH QUALITY: High-quality sealed ISO bottom bracket with CrMo square axle and bearing shells of wrought iron, Hi-Ten Steel Frame, and Stainless Steel 14G Spokes.\nCOMFORT DESIGN: Wide cruiser bar, soft tower cruiser seat with a springer, fully stretch your body and arms, making the riding comfortable.\nEASY INSTALLATION: Fits riders from 5 feet to 6 feet 2 inches tall; comes 85 percent assembled.",
